# Public keys allowed to sign Bento releases (SHA256SUMS.sig), in ssh-keygen ALLOWED SIGNERS format.
# Verify a download:  ssh-keygen -Y verify -f allowed_signers -I bento-release -n bento-release -s SHA256SUMS.sig < SHA256SUMS
# Docs: docs/dev/releasing.md (owner) and docs/user/en/verify-downloads.md (users).
#
# One line per key:  bento-release namespaces="bento-release" ssh-ed25519 AAAA...
# Adding or removing a key is a reviewed commit; keep a retired key here (with valid-before="YYYYMMDD")
# while releases signed by it are still offered.
#
bento-release namespaces="bento-release" ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIFwT4ABdIP8Z/c0yscumdxT8wh2DI9i4YUgpYXf8UJyp
